ble and profitable destination for investment."},{"question":"What does the Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) data represent?","answer":"The Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) data quantifies the total amount of investment made by foreign entities directly into the productive assets of India.^This includes investments in business operations, infrastructure, joint ventures, and acquisitions."}],"related":[{"slug":"10-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (10Y)"},{"slug":"1-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (1Y)"},{"slug":"3-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (3Y)"},{"slug":"5-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (5Y)"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-headline","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation- Headline"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"domestic-institutional-investors-diis-investment-equity","title":"Domestic Institutional Investors (DIIs) Investment - Equity"},{"slug":"foreign-portfolio-investments-fpis-equity","title":"Foreign Portfolio Investments (FPIs) - Equity"},{"slug":"gross-tax-revenue","title":"Gross Tax Revenue"},{"slug":"mutual-fund-aum-equity","title":"Mutual Fund AUM- Equity"},{"slug":"primary-issuances-in-equity-market","title":"Primary Issuances in Equity Market"},{"slug":"repo-rate","title":"Repo Rate"},{"slug":"usd-inr-exchange-rate","title":"USD/INR Exchange Rate"}],"title":"Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI)","description":"Gross FDI inflows into India stand at $ 5,239 Million for Aug 2026. FDI is considered more stable than portfolio flows, typically funding long term capacity.","headline":{"Absolute":"Gross FDI inflows into India stand at $ 5,239 Million for Aug 2026. FDI is considered more stable than portfolio flows, typically funding long term capacity.","Y-o-Y":"Gross FDI inflows int